WEBVTT

01:49.550 --> 01:54.940
[A Dream Within A Dream]

01:55.030 --> 01:57.960
[Episode 13]

02:02.430 --> 02:03.590
It's so late.

02:03.590 --> 02:05.120
What are you doing here, loitering in the

02:05.120 --> 02:07.120
noble Seventh Prince's Residence

02:07.200 --> 02:09.259
instead of going back to your own den?

02:12.120 --> 02:15.650
His Highness's got something on his mind
and wants to talk to me.

02:15.910 --> 02:17.570
If His Highness has troubles,

02:19.280 --> 02:20.560
why wouldn't he talk to me?

02:20.560 --> 02:21.360
This won't do.

02:21.520 --> 02:23.180
I'm going to ask him right now.

02:24.400 --> 02:26.000
He's currently troubled by love

02:26.000 --> 02:27.000
and feeling very distressed.

02:27.000 --> 02:29.000
You'd better not get on his bad side.

02:29.470 --> 02:30.590
Troubled by love?

02:31.400 --> 02:33.200
Is it about that Miss Song again?

02:34.280 --> 02:35.079
Fugui,

02:36.240 --> 02:37.910
shouldn't the Seventh Prince's concerns

02:37.910 --> 02:40.079
be your concerns too?

02:41.470 --> 02:44.240
As His Highness's favorite,

02:44.750 --> 02:46.310
shouldn't you help

02:46.680 --> 02:47.960
ease His Highness's troubles,

02:47.960 --> 02:48.840
Fugui?

02:49.520 --> 02:50.360
Don't worry.

02:51.079 --> 02:52.520
When it comes to His Highness's troubles,

02:52.520 --> 02:54.240
I, Fugui, will take care of it.

02:59.000 --> 03:03.320
[Gentle Breeze and Auspicious Clouds]

03:05.770 --> 03:09.660
[Bookstore]

03:06.400 --> 03:07.190
Have you remembered

03:07.190 --> 03:08.450
everything I told you?

03:08.630 --> 03:09.520
Don't worry, Sir.

03:09.520 --> 03:10.710
We've been working with

03:10.710 --> 03:12.120
Mr. Shangguan for years.

03:12.430 --> 03:14.120
And with these firsthand materials
you provided,

03:14.120 --> 03:16.520
plus the best writers I have in
the capital,

03:16.680 --> 03:18.310
creating this "Exceptional Love"

03:18.310 --> 03:19.310
will be

03:19.310 --> 03:20.960
a piece of cake, Sir.

03:21.680 --> 03:22.710
Remember,

03:23.430 --> 03:24.430
this matter

03:24.630 --> 03:25.680
has absolutely nothing to do with

03:25.680 --> 03:27.010
Shangguan the Useless.

03:28.000 --> 03:29.560
If His Highness asks,

03:29.590 --> 03:31.050
do you know how to respond?

03:32.020 --> 03:33.450
Understood. Understood.

03:33.450 --> 03:35.750
All credit goes to you, Mr. Fugui.

03:37.680 --> 03:38.280
Take this.

03:38.280 --> 03:38.680
Thank you, Sir.

03:38.680 --> 03:39.030
You may go.

03:39.030 --> 03:39.890
Thank you, Sir.

03:40.440 --> 03:44.200
[Fanghua Hall]

03:40.840 --> 03:41.520
My Lady.

03:41.800 --> 03:42.860
Please be careful.

03:48.079 --> 03:49.870
His Majesty doesn't like preserved fruits.

03:49.870 --> 03:50.930
They're too sweet.

03:51.120 --> 03:51.870
Someone,

03:51.870 --> 03:53.170
remove the preserved fruits.

03:53.060 --> 03:57.180
[Fanghua Hall]

03:55.910 --> 03:56.770
Your Highness.

03:57.240 --> 03:58.030
Mother.

03:59.270 --> 04:02.240
[Noble Consort Gao Changrong]

04:00.310 --> 04:01.120
Heng.

04:03.590 --> 04:05.280
The imperial physician told me that

04:05.280 --> 04:06.150
your leg condition has flared up

04:06.150 --> 04:07.430
and you cannot walk.

04:07.630 --> 04:08.430
But you...

04:14.240 --> 04:15.030
Your Highness,

04:14.820 --> 04:18.459
[Prudence and Lasting Virtue]

04:15.070 --> 04:16.720
Her Ladyship has only

04:16.950 --> 04:18.750
been able to leave her bed today.

04:28.820 --> 04:30.500
Your Highness may not know this,

04:30.450 --> 04:33.620
[Prudence and Lasting Virtue]

04:30.920 --> 04:32.510
but His Majesty hasn't visited

04:32.510 --> 04:34.830
Fanghua Hall for three years,

04:36.100 --> 04:38.150
and Her Ladyship had no choice

04:38.170 --> 04:40.490
but to resort to this measure.

04:46.409 --> 04:49.250
[Prudence and Lasting Virtue]

04:47.480 --> 04:48.310
Enough.

04:53.600 --> 04:55.030
All these years,

04:55.390 --> 04:56.250
although

04:56.280 --> 04:58.140
his heart belongs only to Ms. Chu,

04:58.510 --> 05:00.660
out of respect for the Gao family,

05:00.830 --> 05:02.120
he still granted me

05:02.120 --> 05:03.680
the title of Noble Consort.

05:05.630 --> 05:06.720
As long as someday,

05:07.480 --> 05:08.870
I can be buried in the imperial tomb

05:08.870 --> 05:10.270
next to him,

05:10.680 --> 05:11.830
that will be enough.

05:12.040 --> 05:12.830
Mother,

05:13.680 --> 05:15.740
what nonsense are you talking about?

05:17.750 --> 05:18.810
Alright, alright.

05:18.870 --> 05:20.400
I'll stop talking about it.

05:21.510 --> 05:22.310
Heng.

05:22.830 --> 05:25.070
Have court affairs been taxing lately?

05:26.000 --> 05:26.830
You look

05:27.270 --> 05:28.720
much thinner.

05:29.870 --> 05:32.330
It's just I've just returned to
the capital.

05:33.270 --> 05:34.070
Besides,

05:34.480 --> 05:36.240
His Majesty has assigned me many duties.

05:36.240 --> 05:37.040
But it's okay.

05:38.680 --> 05:41.540
His Majesty is willing to entrust you
with work now?

05:41.870 --> 05:42.630
Yes.

05:42.630 --> 05:44.000
Since my return to the capital this time,

05:44.000 --> 05:46.000
His Majesty has shown me much favor.

05:48.190 --> 05:49.120
That's good.

05:49.720 --> 05:52.510
Since His Majesty has changed his mind
and shown you favor,

05:52.510 --> 05:53.430
then you

05:53.480 --> 05:55.240
must perform your duties well, Heng.

05:55.240 --> 05:56.040
By doing so,

05:56.120 --> 05:57.800
you can please him.

05:59.040 --> 06:00.040
I understand.

06:00.510 --> 06:03.190
The capital is quite different from
the frontier.

06:03.190 --> 06:04.680
Besides His Majesty's orders,

06:04.680 --> 06:06.750
you should also listen to your uncle more.

06:06.750 --> 06:07.560
The Gao family

06:07.680 --> 06:09.600
has been in decline since the
previous generation.

06:09.600 --> 06:11.630
If it weren't for your uncle reviving
the family name,

06:11.630 --> 06:14.290
who knows what hardships we
would have endured?

06:15.040 --> 06:16.800
You Gaos are so shameless,

06:16.800 --> 06:19.190
making your mother enter the palace
to be His Majesty's consort

06:19.190 --> 06:21.240
and trying to steal my aunt's spotlight.

06:21.240 --> 06:24.170
There's not a single decent person
in the Gao family.

06:25.240 --> 06:26.170
Don't you agree?

06:26.870 --> 06:28.470
Your mother is a good person.

06:28.830 --> 06:30.230
She has never wronged me.

06:31.100 --> 06:33.159
His Majesty doesn't come to visit you

06:33.310 --> 06:35.840
only because he's angry with
Chancellor Gao.

06:39.390 --> 06:40.650
I understand, Mother.

06:41.560 --> 06:42.360
Heng.

06:43.680 --> 06:46.010
Since His Majesty treats you pretty well,

06:46.720 --> 06:48.000
after all these years,

06:48.070 --> 06:49.120
shouldn't you

06:49.120 --> 06:52.040
start calling him Father?

06:53.920 --> 06:54.950
Shut up!

06:55.270 --> 06:56.159
I don't want to hear

06:56.159 --> 06:57.690
you calling me Father!

07:01.970 --> 07:04.300
I have my own plans regarding this matter,

07:04.630 --> 07:06.290
so you needn't worry, Mother.

07:06.680 --> 07:08.060
I'm more worried about you.

07:08.060 --> 07:10.040
You must take good care of your health.

07:10.040 --> 07:10.830
If you

07:10.850 --> 07:12.000
worry too much,

07:12.120 --> 07:13.720
then when His Majesty comes,

07:13.750 --> 07:15.280
it would be inappropriate.

07:17.430 --> 07:18.240
All right.

07:23.600 --> 07:24.660
By the way, Mother,

07:25.120 --> 07:27.120
do you still have my childhood toys

07:27.430 --> 07:28.430
and belongings?

07:32.830 --> 07:34.159
Your Highness, please.

07:35.510 --> 07:37.870
Since Your Highness left the palace
for the battlefield,

07:37.870 --> 07:40.950
Her Ladyship ordered everything
to be kept here,

07:40.970 --> 07:42.970
and no one was allowed to touch them.

07:43.040 --> 07:44.430
What is Your Highness looking for?

07:44.430 --> 07:45.800
I can help.

07:46.630 --> 07:47.830
I'll look for it myself.

07:47.830 --> 07:48.830
You may leave now.

07:49.870 --> 07:51.000
Yes, Your Highness.

07:52.270 --> 07:55.690
[Ode to the Horse
Green fields lie fresh and lush. Starry eyes gaze high at clouds.
Waiting for the day to transform into a dragon. Leaping upward to the sky.]

08:00.590 --> 08:03.300
[Horse, horse, horse oh horse.]

08:06.420 --> 08:08.140
[Horse, horse, horse oh horse.]

08:13.580 --> 08:17.100
[19 years ago]

08:24.630 --> 08:25.560
Ode to the Horse.

08:26.300 --> 08:28.180
Green fields lie fresh and lush.

08:28.270 --> 08:28.830
Horse.

08:28.830 --> 08:30.650
Starry eyes gaze high at clouds.

08:31.310 --> 08:33.510
Waiting for the day to transform
into a dragon.

08:33.510 --> 08:34.870
Leaping upward to the sky.

08:34.870 --> 08:35.720
Let me copy it.

08:43.270 --> 08:44.480
Ode to the Horse.

09:08.840 --> 09:10.740
I'll give you the Qianyu Military Manual.

09:10.740 --> 09:11.540
Do you want it?

10:04.510 --> 10:05.240
What...

10:05.960 --> 10:07.690
What kind of gibberish is this?

10:07.870 --> 10:09.530
The method of weapon forging?

10:10.270 --> 10:11.330
You must be joking.

10:12.630 --> 10:14.120
This Qianyu Military Manual

10:14.120 --> 10:16.720
was given to me by Chu Guihong
when we were little.

10:16.720 --> 10:18.490
Later, I was banished to the cold palace.

10:18.490 --> 10:20.670
Lord Qianyu sent people to search for it,

10:20.670 --> 10:23.070
and this must be what they
were looking for.

10:25.120 --> 10:26.720
But even if this is the
method of weapon forging,

10:26.720 --> 10:28.180
look at these and symbols.

10:28.390 --> 10:29.150
They're so peculiar.

10:29.150 --> 10:30.700
We can't understand any of it.

10:30.700 --> 10:31.830
How can we decode it?

10:37.670 --> 10:39.080
But we do know someone

10:39.080 --> 10:40.320
who's quite peculiar themselves.

10:40.320 --> 10:40.870
Who?

10:40.870 --> 10:41.440
You?

10:41.960 --> 10:42.820
How can it be me?

10:42.900 --> 10:43.900
Song Yimeng.

10:49.380 --> 10:50.900
Song Yimeng.

10:59.240 --> 11:00.080
This Song Yimeng often has

11:00.080 --> 11:01.720
strange and peculiar things to say,

11:01.720 --> 11:03.550
and she firmly promised before

11:03.550 --> 11:05.130
to help me find the
method of weapon forging.

11:05.130 --> 11:06.990
Perhaps she really can decode it.

11:08.080 --> 11:09.120
That makes sense.

11:10.270 --> 11:11.730
Why didn't I think of that?

11:12.200 --> 11:13.720
As expected of you, Chief Master,

11:13.720 --> 11:15.250
thinking of her right away.

11:15.270 --> 11:16.840
You'll also get to spend more time
with her

11:16.840 --> 11:17.910
while decoding those symbols.

11:17.910 --> 11:20.040
It's killing two birds with one stone.

11:21.910 --> 11:23.790
Hey, I'm talking about serious
matters here.

11:23.790 --> 11:25.080
I'm calling her here strictly for
official business,

11:25.080 --> 11:27.210
with absolutely no personal motives.

11:31.320 --> 11:31.790
Fine.

11:31.790 --> 11:32.990
I won't call her here.

11:33.270 --> 11:34.270
You decode it for me.

11:34.270 --> 11:35.200
Come on, you decode it.

11:35.200 --> 11:36.270
I can't do it.

11:36.380 --> 11:38.530
Only Miss Song can handle this task.

11:45.910 --> 11:47.370
She alone won't be enough.

11:47.510 --> 11:48.270
Look.

11:50.120 --> 11:52.320
When Song Yimeng is researching
the method of weapon forging,

11:52.320 --> 11:53.980
someone needs to monitor her.

11:54.270 --> 11:55.080
This way,

11:55.480 --> 11:58.510
if those symbols truly are the
method of weapon forging,

11:58.510 --> 12:00.840
we can record her entire process

12:00.840 --> 12:02.750
to avoid missing any details.

12:16.990 --> 12:19.270
I didn't expect the height to be
so perfect.

12:19.270 --> 12:20.440
Well, there's no other way then.

12:20.440 --> 12:21.760
This challenging task

12:21.790 --> 12:23.250
has to be entrusted to you.

12:23.720 --> 12:24.510
Me?

12:25.510 --> 12:26.080
I...

12:26.550 --> 12:27.510
I monitor her?

12:28.080 --> 12:28.910
It's not appropriate for me to spy on

12:28.910 --> 12:30.270
the woman you like, right?

12:30.270 --> 12:31.510
I definitely can't do it.

12:31.510 --> 12:32.720
I'm Li Shiliu now,

12:32.720 --> 12:34.120
and I have to be a good guy.

12:34.280 --> 12:35.080
So

12:35.900 --> 12:37.650
this kind of dirty work

12:38.000 --> 12:39.460
has to be entrusted to you.

12:40.250 --> 12:40.840
I...

12:52.530 --> 12:56.000
[Keep Calm]

12:55.910 --> 12:57.440
Stop shaking me.

12:56.030 --> 13:02.000
[As Always]

12:58.080 --> 12:58.960
Whatever it is,

12:59.670 --> 13:02.080
it can wait until after I wake up.

13:03.000 --> 13:04.750
Father, it's only noon.

13:04.750 --> 13:06.360
Please don't sleep yet.

13:07.480 --> 13:08.480
Guihong has

13:08.480 --> 13:10.480
already finished renovating the
southern part of the city.

13:10.480 --> 13:12.480
When will you lift my house arrest?

13:13.840 --> 13:14.960
There's no rush.

13:16.320 --> 13:17.850
After this turmoil passes,

13:18.270 --> 13:19.530
I will help you with it.

13:21.200 --> 13:22.000
Alright.

13:22.320 --> 13:23.480
So my matter is settled.

13:23.480 --> 13:24.150
But what about

13:24.150 --> 13:25.240
Heng's matter?

13:25.840 --> 13:27.480
He went to the Song Residence
a few days ago.

13:27.480 --> 13:30.140
He's secretly colluding with
court officials.

13:30.630 --> 13:33.360
He's trying to steal my position
as crown prince!

13:37.200 --> 13:38.000
Rui.

13:38.750 --> 13:39.720
Let me ask you,

13:40.960 --> 13:42.390
do you have any evidence

13:43.750 --> 13:47.200
that he's conspiring with court officials
to seize your position?

13:47.200 --> 13:48.000
I...

13:50.080 --> 13:51.080
Look, Father.

13:51.080 --> 13:53.320
You know how cunning and devious Heng is.

13:53.320 --> 13:55.080
How could I possibly have any evidence?

13:55.080 --> 13:56.270
Besides, Father,

13:56.480 --> 13:57.320
don't you trust me?

13:57.320 --> 13:58.120
I trust you,

13:58.630 --> 14:00.890
but do all the court officials trust you?

14:02.630 --> 14:03.440
Rui,

14:04.150 --> 14:05.680
you're not a child anymore.

14:05.840 --> 14:08.000
You always act childishly
when problems arise,

14:08.000 --> 14:09.660
forcing me to stand up for you.

14:10.510 --> 14:12.510
What if one day I'm gone?

14:14.080 --> 14:16.120
How will you secure your position,

14:16.150 --> 14:17.440
command the officials,

14:17.440 --> 14:19.120
and protect the empire?

14:20.440 --> 14:22.080
Well, at that time I could, um...

14:22.080 --> 14:23.270
I mean, I could...

14:23.480 --> 14:24.270
I...

14:28.270 --> 14:29.600
This is so frustrating!

14:30.760 --> 14:31.870
Your Highness...

14:31.240 --> 14:33.440
[As Always]

14:32.510 --> 14:33.360
Let him go.

14:38.790 --> 14:40.450
Since his mother passed away,

14:41.390 --> 14:44.030
I've favored him in everything.

14:45.360 --> 14:46.270
I never expected

14:46.270 --> 14:47.360
that I would raise him

14:47.360 --> 14:49.490
to be so impulsive and temperamental.

14:51.080 --> 14:53.610
He's also narrow-minded and
lacks ambition.

14:54.870 --> 14:55.670
Tell me,

14:57.910 --> 14:59.200
was I wrong?

15:03.600 --> 15:04.400
Your Majesty.

15:05.480 --> 15:06.280
Your Majesty.

15:06.600 --> 15:08.930
The Seventh Prince requests an audience.

15:10.270 --> 15:11.270
Let him in.

15:25.070 --> 15:29.820
[Pure of Heart]

15:36.360 --> 15:37.150
I

15:37.260 --> 15:39.060
pay my respects to Your Majesty.

15:39.720 --> 15:42.410
The renovation in the southern
part of the city is complete.

15:42.410 --> 15:43.540
All these memorials

15:44.340 --> 15:47.150
were submitted by your people,

15:47.320 --> 15:50.450
yet they were all praising
Chu Guihong's achievements.

15:50.670 --> 15:51.550
Why is that?

15:54.120 --> 15:56.540
I wouldn't dare to secretly collude with
officials to submit memorials.

15:56.540 --> 15:57.740
For this renovation,

15:57.910 --> 15:59.480
Chu Guihong deserves the most credit,

15:59.480 --> 16:00.810
and should be rewarded.

16:01.030 --> 16:02.490
The officials' memorials

16:02.720 --> 16:04.520
reflect the general consensus.

16:05.630 --> 16:07.240
There's no need for such pretense

16:07.240 --> 16:08.630
in front of me.

16:09.440 --> 16:11.840
You're someone who never acts
without gain.

16:11.840 --> 16:12.630
What do you

16:12.840 --> 16:14.150
want this time?

16:17.840 --> 16:18.640
Your Majesty.

16:19.390 --> 16:21.320
I visited Fanghua Hall yesterday.

16:21.480 --> 16:23.030
Mother has been bedridden for days,

16:23.030 --> 16:24.430
refusing food and drink.

16:25.270 --> 16:26.530
I believe it's because

16:26.600 --> 16:28.000
she misses Your Majesty.

16:33.440 --> 16:34.480
I earnestly beseech Your Majesty to

16:34.480 --> 16:35.510
visit Mother

16:35.840 --> 16:37.700
after tomorrow's court session.

16:54.550 --> 16:55.360
Your Majesty.

16:55.930 --> 16:58.190
The Lantern Festival matter is settled.

16:58.320 --> 16:59.630
At tomorrow's morning court session,

16:59.630 --> 17:01.690
I'll personally propose the request

17:01.790 --> 17:04.440
that you lift Rui's confinement,
Your Majesty.

17:04.440 --> 17:05.569
When the time comes,

17:05.680 --> 17:06.660
Rui

17:07.310 --> 17:08.270
can join me

17:08.270 --> 17:10.670
in attending the Qingtan Musical Banquet.

17:12.530 --> 17:14.800
Are you negotiating terms with me?

17:18.380 --> 17:20.369
Requesting merit for Chu Guihong

17:20.619 --> 17:22.750
and asking to lift Rui's confinement,

17:23.720 --> 17:25.290
all just to have me

17:25.480 --> 17:26.040
visit

17:26.069 --> 17:27.589
your mother?

17:28.810 --> 17:30.350
Brothers should be friendly and respectful
to each other,

17:30.350 --> 17:32.020
and spouses should live in harmony.

17:32.020 --> 17:34.150
These were Your Majesty's teachings,

17:34.400 --> 17:36.090
which I have engraved in my heart

17:36.090 --> 17:37.890
and dare not forget for a moment.

17:39.050 --> 17:39.850
Therefore,

17:42.350 --> 17:43.590
I humbly request Your Majesty

17:43.590 --> 17:45.010
to go and visit Mother.

17:54.130 --> 17:56.150
You know about brotherly

17:56.450 --> 17:57.900
and marital harmony,

17:58.400 --> 17:59.350
yet you don't understand

17:59.350 --> 18:01.240
the principle of filial piety!

18:01.720 --> 18:03.250
Negotiating terms with me,

18:03.790 --> 18:06.450
is this the attitude you should
have towards me?

18:09.120 --> 18:10.420
Your Majesty is the sovereign.

18:10.420 --> 18:12.080
I dare not overstep my bounds.

18:12.880 --> 18:14.480
Since you dare not overstep,

18:14.880 --> 18:15.680
very well,

18:16.110 --> 18:17.350
kneel here

18:18.000 --> 18:20.310
and copy the "Classic of Filial Piety"
10 times,

18:20.310 --> 18:22.770
then I'll visit your mother at
Fanghua Hall.

18:29.670 --> 18:31.070
Thank you, Your Majesty.

18:45.550 --> 18:51.320
♪ The mortal world entangles,
so much sorrow and chill in the mist ♪

18:45.630 --> 18:48.920
[Guangde Gate]

18:54.430 --> 19:00.060
♪ Our fates intertwine and weave
into a story ♪

19:02.300 --> 19:06.240
♪ Listening to the wind whispering
by my ear ♪

19:07.060 --> 19:10.060
♪ The schemes of the dark night ♪

19:10.920 --> 19:15.010
♪ Eyes guarding a single sunrise ♪

19:16.000 --> 19:18.910
♪ When will there be a way home? ♪

19:19.680 --> 19:23.520
♪ Time brings life and death, binding life
but not the heart ♪

19:24.800 --> 19:28.540
♪ Stepping into the ranks of fate,
each pain a prelude ♪

19:29.870 --> 19:33.460
♪ Transformed in a fleeting moment,
like a dream, elusive and near ♪

19:34.430 --> 19:37.930
♪ How can love and hate be hidden? ♪

19:38.800 --> 19:42.100
♪ Time brings life and death, binding life
but not the heart ♪

19:39.070 --> 19:41.000
It was you who led the assassins here,

19:41.000 --> 19:41.830
wasn't it?

19:42.480 --> 19:43.200
Father,

19:42.700 --> 19:46.790
♪ Making all moves in life cautiously,
joy and sorrow already destined ♪

19:43.200 --> 19:43.590
it wasn't me.

19:43.590 --> 19:45.420
This path doesn't lead to the palace!

19:45.420 --> 19:47.270
Why did you take this path?

19:48.040 --> 19:51.820
♪ If one dares oppose Heaven,
how can the ending be rewritten? ♪

19:48.200 --> 19:49.000
Tell me!

19:50.270 --> 19:51.880
Mother brought me here...

19:51.900 --> 19:52.520
To...

19:52.640 --> 19:54.010
To catch wild rabbits.

19:52.700 --> 20:00.010
♪ So close yet still, we part ways ♪

19:54.030 --> 19:54.920
Liar!

20:00.680 --> 20:01.400
Father!

20:01.400 --> 20:02.440
Shut up!

20:02.680 --> 20:05.280
Don't let me hear you call me
Father ever again!

20:05.960 --> 20:08.200
The thing I regret most in my life

20:08.300 --> 20:10.630
is giving birth to a beast like you!

20:11.030 --> 20:12.060
Your Majesty.

20:12.260 --> 20:13.450
As things stand,

20:13.640 --> 20:15.680
he is still of royal blood.

20:15.700 --> 20:17.310
Besides, he's still a little boy.

20:17.310 --> 20:19.370
He can't possibly be the mastermind.

20:38.010 --> 20:41.430
♪ Time brings life and death, binding life
but not the heart ♪

20:42.310 --> 20:45.910
♪ Stepping into the ranks of fate,
each pain a prelude ♪

20:47.610 --> 20:51.390
♪ Transformed in a fleeting moment,
like a dream, elusive and near ♪

20:52.280 --> 20:55.890
♪ How can love and hate be hidden? ♪

20:56.760 --> 20:59.770
♪ Time brings life and death, binding life
but not the heart ♪

21:00.810 --> 21:04.720
♪ Making all moves in life cautiously,
joy and sorrow already destined ♪

21:06.460 --> 21:09.630
♪ If one dares oppose Heaven,
how can the ending be rewritten? ♪

21:10.890 --> 21:18.080
♪ So close yet still, we part ways ♪

21:20.750 --> 21:23.970
♪ If one dares oppose Heaven,
how can the ending be rewritten? ♪

21:39.200 --> 21:40.480
What is this place?

21:40.790 --> 21:42.190
The weapon forging room.

21:42.550 --> 21:44.350
Since the assassination attempt
on the boat failed,

21:44.350 --> 21:45.920
Chief Master has been thinking about

21:45.920 --> 21:49.240
how to free you from the Seventh Prince's
control, Miss Song.

21:49.240 --> 21:51.030
Therefore, he wanted to invite you here

21:51.030 --> 21:52.350
to work together on

21:52.350 --> 21:54.080
this method of weapon forging.

21:55.760 --> 21:57.240
Mr. Li

21:58.070 --> 22:00.160
is also looking for the
method of weapon forging?

22:00.160 --> 22:01.690
The world's sharpest blade

22:01.700 --> 22:03.760
means the strongest military power.

22:03.830 --> 22:06.290
Chief Master is doing this for
your own good.

22:07.150 --> 22:08.970
That's weird.

22:09.140 --> 22:11.200
I clearly remember it's written
in the script that

22:11.200 --> 22:13.030
the method of weapon forging
is a royal secret.

22:13.030 --> 22:15.000
So how did the Nightwalkers

22:15.000 --> 22:16.310
find out about it so easily?

22:16.310 --> 22:16.880
Miss.

22:17.500 --> 22:18.720
You may not trust me,

22:18.720 --> 22:20.690
but don't you trust Chief Master?

22:20.860 --> 22:22.000
The Lantern Festival last time

22:22.000 --> 22:23.030
and the South City incident this time,

22:23.030 --> 22:25.490
wasn't he the one who resolved
every crisis?

22:26.810 --> 22:27.610
That's true.

22:28.480 --> 22:29.880
If Mr. Li were a villain,

22:30.460 --> 22:32.550
there would be no good guys left
in the script.

22:32.550 --> 22:34.400
Letting him get the
method of weapon forging

22:34.400 --> 22:37.600
is better than Nan Heng getting it
and harming the people.

22:40.350 --> 22:41.830
Here's the clue we went to great lengths

22:41.830 --> 22:43.060
to gather.

22:43.720 --> 22:45.180
Miss, you can give it a try.

22:45.480 --> 22:46.550
When Chief Master comes back,

22:46.550 --> 22:48.110
if there's good news,

22:48.240 --> 22:49.840
I'm sure he'll be very happy.

22:50.920 --> 22:51.650
Hold on.

22:52.720 --> 22:54.110
Fe₂O₃?

22:54.110 --> 22:55.930
Why is it a chemical equation?

22:56.750 --> 22:58.380
You actually know it.

23:04.000 --> 23:05.000
Shangguan.

23:05.350 --> 23:06.220
Shangguan!

23:09.650 --> 23:10.150
Oh no.

23:11.440 --> 23:12.970
I'm terrible at chemistry.

23:15.240 --> 23:16.950
This is a historical drama.

23:17.680 --> 23:19.540
Why is there a chemical equation?

23:21.260 --> 23:24.190
Could this really be a clue left
by the screenwriter?

23:43.410 --> 23:46.380
If it weren't because I couldn't
balance chemical equations,

23:46.380 --> 23:47.850
how would I have ended up choosing
liberal arts?

23:47.850 --> 23:49.480
If I hadn't chosen liberal arts,

23:49.480 --> 23:50.840
how would I have become an actress?

23:50.840 --> 23:51.960
If I hadn't become an actress,

23:51.960 --> 23:53.640
how would I have traveled back here?

23:53.640 --> 23:56.080
And yet here, I still have to deal
with chemistry.

23:56.080 --> 23:57.970
What kind of fate is this?

23:58.500 --> 24:00.100
What is she muttering about?

24:08.640 --> 24:09.440
What's this?

24:17.000 --> 24:18.000
This should work.

24:39.440 --> 24:40.900
I guess I can add a bit more.

24:51.750 --> 24:52.670
Like this.

24:53.590 --> 24:54.790
This should work now.

25:09.830 --> 25:11.230
It should be fine, right?

25:36.640 --> 25:37.570
Oh no.

25:38.090 --> 25:40.150
This... This won't explode, will it?

25:56.400 --> 25:57.150
Miss Song!

25:57.270 --> 25:58.200
Miss Song!

25:58.200 --> 25:59.280
Are you alright?

25:59.590 --> 26:00.680
Miss Song!

26:04.830 --> 26:06.460
Such strong toxic fumes!

26:06.880 --> 26:07.960
Could it be an assassination attempt

26:07.960 --> 26:09.200
by another gang?

26:09.920 --> 26:10.710
Let's go!

26:20.270 --> 26:21.260
You are...

26:23.030 --> 26:24.140
Miss Song?

26:24.160 --> 26:25.490
I've told you

26:26.000 --> 26:27.730
that I'm not good at chemistry.

26:28.030 --> 26:28.960
Why did you have to

26:28.960 --> 26:30.820
make me do this?

26:33.160 --> 26:34.290
What happened here?

26:34.900 --> 26:36.560
How did the explosion happen?

26:37.590 --> 26:39.130
Chief Master, it's like this.

26:39.130 --> 26:41.330
We had someone do a fortune reading,

26:41.510 --> 26:43.110
and they said Miss Song has fire energy
in her destiny,

26:43.110 --> 26:45.370
so wherever she goes, things catch fire.

26:49.070 --> 26:50.090
It's true.

26:50.480 --> 26:52.200
But Chief Master, don't worry.

26:52.200 --> 26:54.240
We started our business with
water transport,

26:54.240 --> 26:55.270
and you have strong water energy
in your destiny,

26:55.270 --> 26:55.920
which can keep it under control...

26:55.920 --> 26:57.000
Enough. Shut up.

26:58.880 --> 26:59.480
You tell me

26:59.880 --> 27:00.740
what happened.

27:00.960 --> 27:01.880
Miss Song is

27:02.240 --> 27:03.070
a master.

27:03.240 --> 27:06.240
She's capable of destroying
an entire city on her own.

27:06.440 --> 27:07.160
Go away.

27:13.640 --> 27:14.350
Alright, they're gone.

27:14.350 --> 27:15.480
You can come out now.

27:19.440 --> 27:20.160
How did Song Yimeng

27:20.160 --> 27:21.750
cause such a commotion?

27:22.070 --> 27:23.030
Chief Master.

27:23.200 --> 27:26.260
For the sake of all the years I've
risked my life for you,

27:26.270 --> 27:28.360
please spare Song Yimeng,

27:28.550 --> 27:30.140
and spare me too!

27:30.240 --> 27:33.350
Whenever you two try to do something, I'm
always the one who gets hurt.

27:33.350 --> 27:35.510
Last assassination attempt nearly
got me killed,

27:35.510 --> 27:37.720
and this time I almost lost my eyesight.

27:38.110 --> 27:40.060
I'm not Shangguan the Useless.

27:40.270 --> 27:43.330
I'm more like the Unlucky Useless!

28:00.400 --> 28:01.200
Song Yimeng.

28:01.510 --> 28:02.540
I'm not here!

28:09.860 --> 28:10.830
Mr. Li.

28:11.020 --> 28:12.530
It really is Mr. Li.

28:12.830 --> 28:13.590
What's wrong?

28:13.590 --> 28:14.590
You're not even afraid of setting fires,

28:14.590 --> 28:16.850
yet you're scared of applying ointment?

28:17.110 --> 28:18.750
I... Let me clarify again,

28:18.880 --> 28:20.280
I wasn't setting a fire,

28:20.300 --> 28:21.110
I just

28:21.110 --> 28:23.370
added a tiny bit of special ingredients.

28:24.720 --> 28:25.320
Alright.

28:25.350 --> 28:26.020
Come on,

28:26.190 --> 28:26.920
turn around.

28:26.940 --> 28:28.870
Let me apply some ointment for you.

28:29.620 --> 28:30.710
Mr. Li.

28:30.740 --> 28:32.610
You can just leave the ointment here.

28:32.610 --> 28:33.880
I'll do it myself.

28:33.960 --> 28:35.030
Please leave.

28:35.030 --> 28:36.030
I'm not Nan Heng.

28:36.030 --> 28:37.270
Why should you be afraid?

28:37.270 --> 28:39.930
If you were Nan Heng, I wouldn't
be afraid at all.

28:42.410 --> 28:44.070
Come on, turn around. Be good.

28:44.100 --> 28:45.340
I-I-I can't.

28:45.540 --> 28:46.070
Mr. Li...

28:46.110 --> 28:46.550
It's fine, come on.

28:46.550 --> 28:48.680
Mr. Li, my face really isn't
presentable today.

28:48.680 --> 28:49.200
It's okay.

28:49.200 --> 28:49.590
Really, please step outside.

28:49.590 --> 28:50.200
Be good.

28:54.420 --> 28:56.470
I already told you, Mr. Li.

28:57.180 --> 28:59.360
My face isn't presentable today.

29:31.820 --> 29:34.170
♪ Look up in the sky ♪

29:35.240 --> 29:37.590
♪ I see diamond little stars ♪

29:39.140 --> 29:43.380
♪ Dancing and shining ♪

29:45.410 --> 29:47.920
♪ Look into your eyes ♪

29:48.960 --> 29:51.360
♪ I see tiny little diamonds ♪

29:52.690 --> 29:57.470
♪ Glowing and sparkling ♪

29:59.310 --> 30:03.550
♪ In the mirror of your sight ♪

30:05.970 --> 30:09.330
♪ I can see the changing world ♪

30:12.490 --> 30:17.650
♪ Like the rhythm of our heart ♪

30:19.790 --> 30:23.750
♪ I can feel the dancing stars ♪

30:26.560 --> 30:29.150
♪ Look into your eyes ♪

30:29.990 --> 30:32.620
♪ I see tiny little diamonds ♪

30:33.800 --> 30:38.390
♪ Glowing and shining ♪

30:40.130 --> 30:42.970
♪ In the world and in heaven ♪

30:44.140 --> 30:49.110
♪ Among the stars, our love is forever ♪

31:20.070 --> 31:23.580
[River Dolphin Chuichui]
[River Dolphin Benben]

31:21.280 --> 31:24.300
♪ In the world and in heaven ♪

31:25.060 --> 31:30.320
♪ Among the stars, our love is forever ♪

31:39.310 --> 31:40.200
Um.

31:43.030 --> 31:45.110
Your face is blushing.

31:51.590 --> 31:52.680
How could this be?

31:53.810 --> 31:56.110
I have such thick skin.

31:56.720 --> 31:58.670
I never blush at all.

32:00.920 --> 32:01.960
See for yourself.

32:13.350 --> 32:15.150
It's just high-altitude flush.

32:18.860 --> 32:20.260
It was my fault this time.

32:20.470 --> 32:22.130
I'll accompany you next time.

32:24.460 --> 32:26.190
There's going to be a next time?

32:29.090 --> 32:30.310
The thing is,

32:30.550 --> 32:32.820
as long as we don't obtain the
method of weapon forging,

32:32.820 --> 32:35.020
we have no way to fight against Nan Heng.

32:38.240 --> 32:39.030
That's true.

32:42.110 --> 32:43.720
Do you think in this world,

32:44.310 --> 32:47.240
there are truly fathers and sons
who hate each other?

32:48.880 --> 32:50.380
The method of weapon forging

32:50.380 --> 32:53.750
is the trump card His Majesty left for
the Eighteenth Prince to protect himself,

32:53.750 --> 32:55.610
but Nan Heng has always wanted to get it.

32:55.610 --> 32:56.570
Why is that?

32:58.660 --> 33:00.120
Because he wants to rebel.

33:01.840 --> 33:02.900
Rebellion

33:03.270 --> 33:04.000
means that

33:04.000 --> 33:05.640
many people will die.

33:05.970 --> 33:07.350
So even if I obtained

33:07.350 --> 33:08.460
this method of weapon forging,

33:08.460 --> 33:09.860
I wouldn't give it to him.

33:10.150 --> 33:11.560
How can you be so certain

33:11.660 --> 33:13.390
that he wants it for rebellion?

33:14.330 --> 33:16.330
Because it's written in the script.

33:18.040 --> 33:19.140
The script again.

33:20.310 --> 33:21.680
If he does plan to rebel,

33:22.710 --> 33:24.020
what do you plan to do?

33:28.890 --> 33:29.680
I don't know.

33:29.700 --> 33:31.300
I haven't made up my mind yet.

33:31.550 --> 33:34.280
Just stopping him is difficult enough
right now.

33:35.170 --> 33:37.410
But I still want to find another way,

33:37.760 --> 33:39.910
a way that can help Nan Heng

33:40.070 --> 33:41.510
let go of his hatred.

33:46.290 --> 33:47.440
Have you considered

33:48.710 --> 33:50.400
what if I told others

33:51.070 --> 33:52.930
about everything you've told me?

33:53.160 --> 33:54.420
What would you do then?

33:54.540 --> 33:55.670
That's impossible.

33:56.220 --> 33:57.720
You're Mr. Li.

34:01.310 --> 34:03.140
You're the person I trust

34:04.350 --> 34:05.510
most in this world.

34:18.960 --> 34:19.800
Miss Song.

34:20.889 --> 34:23.280
You can never truly know what's
in someone's heart.

34:23.280 --> 34:24.780
Being so quick to trust others

34:24.780 --> 34:26.710
will only end up hurting yourself.

34:27.460 --> 34:29.150
I am not a good person,

34:29.380 --> 34:30.670
nor am I

34:30.670 --> 34:32.730
the virtuous man you make me out to be.

34:33.510 --> 34:34.620
Mr. Li.

34:34.920 --> 34:37.230
I'm not someone who trusts others easily,

34:37.230 --> 34:38.360
but you're different.

34:38.360 --> 34:40.290
I'm no different from anyone else.

34:44.170 --> 34:45.170
In a moment,

34:45.199 --> 34:47.070
I'll have Shangguan He escort you back.

34:47.070 --> 34:49.800
I have matters to attend to, so I'll
take my leave.

34:50.270 --> 34:51.250
Mr. Li.

34:51.440 --> 34:52.320
Mr. Li!

34:56.270 --> 34:57.310
That's weird.

35:00.890 --> 35:02.330
What's gotten into him?

35:40.280 --> 35:41.080
Chief Master.

35:42.150 --> 35:43.480
I've escorted her back.

35:44.320 --> 35:45.420
Look at you.

35:45.590 --> 35:47.030
You're the one who drew her in,

35:47.030 --> 35:48.710
and you're the one pushing her away.

35:48.710 --> 35:50.370
What are you really thinking?

35:52.480 --> 35:53.540
Take a look at this.

35:57.190 --> 35:58.400
Isn't this that strange symbol

35:58.400 --> 35:59.880
from the method of weapon forging?

35:59.880 --> 36:00.880
She completed it?

36:01.760 --> 36:03.360
I didn't expect that either.

36:03.480 --> 36:04.680
However, this symbol

36:04.920 --> 36:07.780
differs from the one in the
Qianyu Military Manual,

36:07.800 --> 36:10.400
so it might not be the
method of weapon forging.

36:12.510 --> 36:13.110
Well then.

36:13.940 --> 36:14.890
I want you

36:14.910 --> 36:16.030
to go search for

36:16.030 --> 36:17.550
scholars across the land in secret
immediately

36:17.550 --> 36:20.150
to see if anyone recognizes
these characters.

36:21.590 --> 36:22.400
Understood.

36:23.230 --> 36:24.030
Hold on.

36:25.840 --> 36:26.630
I'm planning

36:26.760 --> 36:28.000
to hold the Qingtan Musical Banquet

36:28.000 --> 36:29.460
at Waning River Crescent.

36:29.710 --> 36:30.510
Why?

36:31.110 --> 36:32.770
These days, our Nightwalkers

36:32.960 --> 36:34.800
have been gathering information everywhere

36:34.800 --> 36:36.630
and searching for clues about the
method of weapon forging,

36:36.630 --> 36:38.630
which has consumed enormous funds.

36:38.630 --> 36:39.630
I originally intended

36:39.630 --> 36:41.590
to transfer funds from my mansion,

36:42.190 --> 36:44.030
but unfortunately, every outgoing
transaction of the mansion

36:44.030 --> 36:46.030
has to be monitored by the
Imperial Household Department,

36:46.030 --> 36:48.320
and every movement of funds
requires documentation

36:48.320 --> 36:49.190
and proof.

36:49.960 --> 36:50.960
So you want to use

36:50.960 --> 36:53.150
the opportunity of hosting the
Qingtan Musical Banquet

36:53.150 --> 36:54.630
to transfer funds here?

36:56.150 --> 36:56.880
Exactly.

36:57.550 --> 36:58.800
Do you know how big that banquet will be

36:58.800 --> 37:00.510
and how many people we'll have to invite?

37:00.510 --> 37:02.440
It will take a lot of time to prepare.

37:02.440 --> 37:03.710
And you know, those young masters

37:03.710 --> 37:05.710
and noble ladies are difficult
to deal with.

37:05.710 --> 37:08.110
Just thinking about it gives me
a headache.

37:08.180 --> 37:09.910
You should find another venue.

37:11.880 --> 37:12.680
Alright then.

37:14.120 --> 37:16.250
We can hold it at your mansion instead.

37:16.270 --> 37:19.000
Let's hold it at Waning River Crescent
after all.

37:23.480 --> 37:25.440
February 6th. Windy.

37:25.480 --> 37:27.480
The scent of plum blossoms carried
on the breeze.

37:27.480 --> 37:30.960
No desire to enjoy the fragrance,
thinking only of Miss Song.

37:31.670 --> 37:33.670
February 7th. Light rain.

37:33.670 --> 37:35.760
Raindrops tap against my lonely heart,

37:35.760 --> 37:39.150
yet nothing compares to Yiting's
gentle swaying steps.

37:39.150 --> 37:41.550
I miss you, Miss Song.

37:44.110 --> 37:45.710
Take these out and burn them,

37:45.760 --> 37:48.090
far away so they don't dirty my courtyard.

37:48.360 --> 37:49.150
Yes.

37:52.110 --> 37:53.510
Don't burn them.

37:54.110 --> 37:56.320
This time, I've inquired about it for you.

37:56.320 --> 37:57.550
The Eighteenth Prince will also attend

37:57.550 --> 37:59.320
the Qingtan Musical Banquet.

37:59.630 --> 38:02.710
You're skilled in poetry and music.

38:02.800 --> 38:04.320
Isn't this a heaven-sent

38:04.320 --> 38:07.650
opportunity to showcase yourself
in front of His Highness?

38:08.400 --> 38:10.230
What exactly do you take me for, Mother?

38:10.230 --> 38:12.280
Playing music, writing poetry,
showing off talents—

38:12.280 --> 38:14.310
am I just a plaything on stage
for others' amusement?

38:14.310 --> 38:16.400
What's the meaning of all this?

38:16.400 --> 38:19.110
Of course it has meaning!

38:19.320 --> 38:20.180
Think about it.

38:20.320 --> 38:22.230
If it weren't for these accomplishments,

38:22.230 --> 38:23.440
how could you possibly

38:23.440 --> 38:25.510
stand out among so many daughters

38:25.510 --> 38:26.700
from wealthy families

38:26.700 --> 38:28.310
and marry a noble husband?

38:29.290 --> 38:30.890
So my existence in this world

38:31.000 --> 38:32.800
is only for the sake of marriage?

38:33.150 --> 38:34.880
If not for marriage, then what?

38:35.000 --> 38:36.550
Don't tell me you want to take

38:36.550 --> 38:37.920
the imperial exams and become an official.

38:37.920 --> 38:39.000
Why not?

38:40.150 --> 38:41.360
Even if that were possible,

38:41.360 --> 38:43.110
you'd have to become the Empress first

38:43.110 --> 38:45.710
and have the Emperor change
the system for you.

38:52.190 --> 38:53.320
It will leave a scar.

38:54.690 --> 38:55.890
It won't leave a scar.

38:56.360 --> 38:57.400
Scar.

38:58.070 --> 38:58.760
No scar.

38:59.970 --> 39:01.400
Easy.

39:01.440 --> 39:02.920
It hurts so much, Xia.

39:03.650 --> 39:06.910
Better a moment of pain than
prolonged suffering, My Lady.

39:10.680 --> 39:12.820
He hadn't even finished applying
the ointment for me yet.

39:12.820 --> 39:14.970
Why did he suddenly leave?

39:16.000 --> 39:18.930
You're talking about Li Shiliu,
aren't you, My Lady?

39:22.960 --> 39:25.090
But what matters most right now

39:25.230 --> 39:27.230
isn't really Mr. Li's attitude.

39:28.670 --> 39:31.110
But My Lady, you'll have to marry
someone eventually.

39:31.110 --> 39:31.920
Before,

39:32.150 --> 39:34.550
we thought it would be
General Chu Guihong.

39:34.630 --> 39:36.880
Who would have thought
Li Shiliu would come along,

39:36.880 --> 39:38.540
as well as the Seventh Prince.

39:39.670 --> 39:40.920
Those words, "Seventh Prince,"

39:40.920 --> 39:42.440
how could they even come up here?

39:42.440 --> 39:43.230
Bad luck.

39:43.880 --> 39:46.440
"Exceptional Love" is already written
like that.

39:46.440 --> 39:49.110
There's no need to play dumb
with us anymore, My Lady.

39:49.110 --> 39:49.880
What love?

39:50.150 --> 39:51.030
What love are you talking about?

39:51.030 --> 39:52.190
"Exceptional Love."

39:52.190 --> 39:53.390
"Exceptional Love?"

39:54.150 --> 39:55.710
These past two days, the servants
in the mansion

39:55.710 --> 39:57.190
have been secretly passing it around,

39:55.770 --> 39:58.140
[Exceptional Love]

39:57.320 --> 39:59.630
saying you and the Seventh Prince
are meant for each other,

39:59.630 --> 40:00.670
a perfect match.

40:03.000 --> 40:04.130
Stirring up gossip?

40:04.880 --> 40:05.630
Marketing?

40:05.630 --> 40:07.560
Like he did with "Illusory Dream."

40:08.110 --> 40:09.230
I'm used to it by now.

40:09.230 --> 40:10.880
Nothing surprises me anymore.

40:10.880 --> 40:12.000
It's not the first time

40:12.000 --> 40:14.150
he's pulled these cheap tricks.

40:14.550 --> 40:18.010
How can you be so sure it's the
Seventh Prince's doing, My Lady?

40:18.150 --> 40:20.150
You still don't know villains well.

40:21.110 --> 40:22.840
What kind of person is Nan Heng?

40:23.000 --> 40:24.070
A scheming snake,

40:24.230 --> 40:25.430
full of dirty tricks.

40:25.710 --> 40:27.400
I'm telling you right now,

40:27.400 --> 40:29.070
if he's not behind this,

40:29.150 --> 40:30.550
I'll eat my hat.

40:30.880 --> 40:32.550
I knew these rumors couldn't be trusted.

40:32.550 --> 40:34.550
I know you only have Li Shiliu
in your heart, My Lady.

40:34.550 --> 40:35.840
Don't talk nonsense.

40:36.670 --> 40:38.870
Nothing's even started between us yet.

40:39.800 --> 40:41.840
Besides, his attitude towards me

40:42.400 --> 40:44.000
is always so unpredictable,

40:44.510 --> 40:46.110
I really can't read his mind.

40:46.190 --> 40:47.550
Then why don't you

40:47.550 --> 40:49.280
just ask him directly, My Lady?

40:54.920 --> 40:55.760
If

40:56.440 --> 40:57.280
I were to

40:57.710 --> 40:59.510
take the initiative and ask him,

41:00.000 --> 41:02.070
wouldn't it seem a bit...

41:06.550 --> 41:07.670
What's there to ask?

41:07.670 --> 41:09.000
Haven't I told you already?

41:09.000 --> 41:11.260
It's just a partnership, a partnership.

41:12.920 --> 41:13.920
That makes sense.

41:14.360 --> 41:16.030
How could you possibly like Mr. Li,
My Lady?

41:16.030 --> 41:17.550
You haven't even seen his face yet.

41:17.550 --> 41:18.410
For all we know,

41:18.550 --> 41:19.550
he could be covered in sores,

41:19.550 --> 41:20.440
oozing pus everywhere,

41:20.440 --> 41:21.570
bald and toothless.

41:21.840 --> 41:23.360
And if you think about it,

41:23.360 --> 41:24.800
he might be of poor character,

41:24.800 --> 41:26.320
robbing and killing, pillaging and
looting.

41:26.320 --> 41:26.710
He might even...

41:26.710 --> 41:27.510
Stop, stop.

41:27.880 --> 41:29.920
What nonsense are you talking about?

41:29.920 --> 41:31.480
He's upright and kind,

41:31.480 --> 41:32.670
loyal to his friends,

41:32.670 --> 41:34.150
tall and wealthy,

41:34.510 --> 41:35.570
and owns property.

41:36.320 --> 41:38.050
Although his job isn't stable,

41:38.110 --> 41:39.110
no matter what,

41:39.190 --> 41:40.550
he could be considered

41:40.760 --> 41:42.030
a small entrepreneur, right?

41:42.030 --> 41:43.320
You say you don't like him,

41:43.320 --> 41:45.280
but you can't stand hearing even
half a flaw about him.

41:45.280 --> 41:46.110
My Lady.

41:46.110 --> 41:48.320
You'll be turning 25 by spring.

41:48.510 --> 41:49.550
When do you plan

41:49.550 --> 41:51.510
to confess your feelings to Mr. Li?

41:51.510 --> 41:53.480
The wedding dress definitely has to be
the latest style.

41:53.480 --> 41:55.070
Should we choose the shop in the south

41:55.070 --> 41:56.110
or the one in the north of town?

41:56.110 --> 41:57.670
And the invitation cards, they must be...

41:57.670 --> 41:58.320
Stop.

41:58.510 --> 42:00.440
Can you two please not start talking

42:00.440 --> 42:02.630
about my love life the moment you appear?

42:02.630 --> 42:04.630
Don't you know that in Hong Kong dramas,

42:04.630 --> 42:06.670
"just find a man and get married"

42:06.670 --> 42:07.930
is actually an insult?

42:08.400 --> 42:10.280
Talking about

42:10.280 --> 42:11.480
marriage all the time.

42:11.480 --> 42:13.320
Will it ever end? So annoying.

42:14.510 --> 42:16.400
My Lady, Master wants to see you.

42:16.710 --> 42:17.510
What for?

42:18.000 --> 42:19.600
To talk about your marriage.

42:30.190 --> 42:32.990
This writing is neither clerical nor
seal script,

42:35.230 --> 42:38.760
but rather resembles the ancient ritual
bronze inscriptions.

42:42.160 --> 42:44.470
What could its meaning be?

42:56.110 --> 42:56.920
Father.

42:58.440 --> 42:59.630
Why do you have this?

43:00.030 --> 43:01.510
What happened to your face?

43:01.510 --> 43:03.510
It's nothing, just a small scratch.

43:03.590 --> 43:05.320
Where did you get this note?

43:07.710 --> 43:09.110
You recognize this?

43:10.660 --> 43:12.610
Word on the street says

43:12.840 --> 43:14.080
this is

43:14.150 --> 43:16.340
the formula for the
method of weapon forging.
